[Name: Marlow Reed |Role: Dockhand / Brawler |Affiliation: Dockhands, Lantern Coast |Species,Race,standing: Human, Coast resident |Age: 31 |
Appearance: Broad and sunburnt, forearms scarred by rope, a docker's hook on his belt. |Behavior: Laughs loudly, leans on whatever is nearest, and never lets a friend carry a crate alone. |Personality: Warm, stubborn and slow to anger, terrifying once he is there. |Wants: Enough saved to buy his own boat. |Fears: Being a burden to the people who rely on him.]

